{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09276","headline":"春月观省属城始憩东西林精舍 · 韦应物","name":"春月观省属城始憩东西林精舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"因时省风俗，布惠迨高年。\n建隼出浔阳，整驾游山川。\n白云敛晴壑，羣峰列遥天。\n嶔㟢石门状，杳霭香炉烟。\n榛荒屡罥罣，偪侧殆覆颠。\n方臻释氏庐，时物屡华妍。\n昙远昔经始，於兹閟幽玄。\n东西竹林寺，灌注寒涧泉。\n人事即云泯，岁月复已绵。\n殿宇余丹绀，磴阁峭欹悬。\n佳士亦栖息，善身绝尘缘。\n今我蒙朝寄，教化敷里鄽。\n道妙苟爲得，出处理无偏。\n心当同所尚，迹岂辞缠牵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}